  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 301.14 “Final report” means the report submitted to the department after the pumping test and water quality sampling program is conducted at the proposed well site.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 301) #11060, eff 4-1-16",
